==Strategy==
The intended strategy for this stage is to abuse the [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metals]] as stepping stones for your [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] in order to snipe and whittle down Dogumaru before they stack, so you'll have enough ground to prevent the Hackeys from pushing to your base. As the stage is effectively timed, you're advised to bring a Rich Cat and use the Kang Roos for money. Li'l Doges dodging might slow you down, but usually your wave attackers will help you to quickly gain ground. Then it's a matter of spamming your meatshields and attackers to the extent where Dogumaru gets consistently chipped and eventually is destroyed, while Aku Gory fails to break through your frontlines. When the Dogumaru are gone before the Hackeys can get far enough, the stage is effectively won.

